  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingImpairmentLossTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;※７　減損損失&lt;/p&gt;
